{"text": "Perhaps I will fall right through the earth, she said to herself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I will meet the people who walk with their heads downward. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She would ask them, Please, Madam, is this New Zealand or Australia. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She even tried to curtsey while she was falling through the air. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was nothing else to do, so Alice soon began talking again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dinah will miss me very much tonight, said Alice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dinah was the cat that Alice had left at home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I hope they will remember her saucer of milk at teatime. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There are no mice in the air, but a bat is very much like a mouse. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But do cats eat bats, she wondered sleepily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She began to dream that she was walking hand in hand with Dinah. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, thump, thump, Alice landed on a heap of sticks and dry leaves.", "alignment": {"characters": ["P", "e", "r", "h", "a", "p", "s", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "f", "a", "l", "l", " ", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "t", "h", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "a", "r", "t", "h", ",", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "h", "e", "r", "s", "e", "l", "f", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "m", "e", "e", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", "i", "r", " ", "h", "e", "a", "d", "s", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", "w", "a", "r", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "a", "s", "k", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ",